:"tvdb_show","id":"339076","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[48]}]},{"sourceEpisodeNumber":49,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11291","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[49]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21236","episodeNumbers":[49]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31049","episodeNumbers":[49]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"67667","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[49]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"339076","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[49]}]},{"sourceEpisodeNumber":50,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11291","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[50]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21236","episodeNumbers":[50]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31049","episodeNumbers":[50]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"67667","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[50]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"339076","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[50]}]},{"sourceEpisodeNumber":51,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11291","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[51]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21236","episodeNumbers":[51]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31049","episodeNumbers":[51]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"67667","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[51]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"339076","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[51]}]}]},"checkedAt":1793476823827,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":[{"title":"Kerbeus: Guard Dog of the Underworld!","synopsis":"Valt has emerged as the winner of his first round at the local tournament! Shu finds himself shocked that the battle against The Boss ended with a Burst Finish. While Valt excites himself to begin his intensive training, he is invited by Nika and Tokonatsu to see a puppet show. But the contents of the puppet show was slightly unusual. And, as the second round of the local tournament begins, the opponent facing Valt is Kensuke Midorikawa, the puppet-controlling Blader.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448022.jpg"},{"title":"Blast Off! Rush Launch!","synopsis":"The match between Valt and Kensuke reaches its third battle. However, Valt is overcome by his nerves and ends up dropping Valkyrie. The ones appearing before Valt to pick up his Valkyrie are none other than Kensuke's puppets, Ker and Beus and, at that moment, Valt remembers that...? Finally, the match between Valt and Kensuke concludes! Who is the winner!?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448023.jpg"},{"title":"Beyblade Club: Let`s Get Started!","synopsis":"Valt is excited to start a Beyblade club at school, naming himself club captain; his first challenge is to convince others to join.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448024.jpg"},{"title":"Into the Darkness! Dark Doomscizor!","synopsis":"Valt's next opponent is Daina Kurogami. Kensuke has a bad feeling about Daina's provocation before the match. His bad feelings were correct, as Valt's Rush Shoot is completely nullified in this match. As Daina provokes him more and more, Valt becomes unable to perform a Rush Shoot at all..!?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448026.jpg"},{"title":"Get Ready! Crash Course","synopsis":"At the Regionals, Shu and Wakiya continue to win against strong rivals one after the other. Besides that, Boss and the others tell Valt his weakpoint that he gets heated up too easily. Valt then starts special training to try and fix it, but fails constantly... However, in Valt's Failed Shoots, Daina realizes something...?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448027.jpg"},{"title":"The Flash Launch! It`s Crazy Fast!","synopsis":"Valt is suffering from his inability to use his Special Move. However, some advice from Shu inspires Valt to create a new Special Move, so he undergoes special training. Furthermore, facing his next opponent, the intensity of the battle puts Valt in a troubling situation...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448028.jpg"},{"title":"A Powerful Opponent! Hyper Horusood!","synopsis":"Hoji's Horusood uses it's Special Move, which utilises Horusood's unique features. As other rivals intently watch these two battle, why is Valt still smiling?!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448030.jpg"},{"title":"Wyvron in the Way!","synopsis":"Orochi Ginba helps Nika, who got lost. Orochi, who is said to have a divine hearing, finds himself interested in the sound that Valt's launches create. Furthermore, Wakiya, who has started taking an interest in Valt, lures him out by ordering a delivery of bread and forcefully begins a battle!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448032.jpg"},{"title":"Get Over It! Trust in Valtryek!","synopsis":"After being overwhelmed by Wakiya, Valt falls into a slump. Rantaro, who is worried about Valt, suggests that they have some battles for a change of pace. But, as Valt continues to be defeated in the battles, he starts to isolate himself in his room. And then, while walking down a street, Orochi sees Shu coming out of a hospital...!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448035.jpg"},{"title":"Spryzen`s Despair!","synopsis":"Valt finds out about Shu's predicament as the semi-finals are about to begin","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448037.jpg"},{"title":"Shield Crash Menace!","synopsis":"Valt's battle against Wakiya continues; Shu takes on Orochi Ginba.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448039.jpg"},{"title":"Shu`s Test!","synopsis":"Orochi starts to lose his cool in the battle against Shu; Valt gears up for the district tournament final but soon discovers just how severe Shu's injury is.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448041.jpg"},{"title":"The Battle We Promised!","synopsis":"Valt is stuck between following through with a promise and protecting his friend and he has to make a tough decision.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6448044.jpg"},{"title":"A Fierce Battle! Valtryek Versus Spryzen!","synopsis":"The District Tournament Final heats up, pitting Valt's fierce Flash Launch against Shu's new Upper Launch.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6599058.jpg"},{"title":"A Group Lesson! Shakadera Special!","synopsis":"On a trip to Xander's village, the gang finds it to be full of ninja traps and interesting characters.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6599060.jpg"},{"title":"Extreme Xcalius!","synopsis":"Xander shows off his skills with Xcalius; the team tries to keep up with his intense training regimen.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6599061.jpg"},{"title":"Team Battle! It`s off the Hook!","synopsis":"A hidden member of Xander's team is revealed.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6599062.jpg"},{"title":"Roktavor vs Unicrest!","synopsis":"Rantaro takes on Ukio in the team battle; Ken has something important to reveal.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/339076/episodes/5f4b2926cc18d.jpg"},{"title":"Bring It Together! Chain Launch!","synopsis":"Ken takes on the Sword Flames and with new found determination and his friends behind him, Ken appears more powerful than ever before.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6604944.jpg"},{"title":"A Battle of Friendship!","synopsis":"Just before a match, Ken is rattled by Xander and his powerful new technique; Valt's must face Xander in a three-point match.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6608060.jpg"},{"title":"Valtryek Awakens!","synopsis":"The Beigoma team is given a second chance to enter the National Tournament; Valt faces Ukio in his first match and manages to pull off something extraordinary.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6615145.jpg"},{"title":"Lonely Doomscizor!","synopsis":"The pressure of the tournament is making Daigo nervous about his upcoming match against Yugo; Rantaro and Hoji find out that they'll have to take on their close friends next.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6627256.jpg"},{"title":"Full Strength, for Real!","synopsis":"A poorly-disguised Blader starts making an appearance in the Beyblading world; Rantaro and Hoji find themselves in the same practice space.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6628786.jpg"},{"title":"The Mysterious Masked Blader!","synopsis":"The ever outrageous Zac the Sunrise, disguised as the Masked Blader, gets to know Toko and Nika; Zac challenges Wakiya to a battle; Rantaro delivers terrible news to Valt.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6640893.jpg"},{"title":"Let`s Do This Thing! On to Nationals!","synopsis":"A guilty Daigo makes amends; Valt must find a way to beat Orochi in the A-block finals if he is to score an invitation to Nationals.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6640894.jpg"},{"title":"Training Camp! The Biting Stadium!","synopsis":"With Wakiya joining the Beyclub, the team travels to his cabin for a training retreat.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6649788.jpg"},{"title":"Mountains! Rivers! A Huge Stormy Adventure!","synopsis":"While the team trains at Wakiya's cabin, Toko and Nika become lost.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/339076/6649789.jpg"},{"title":"Eye on the Prize!","synopsis":"Valt is chosen to be in the opening ceremony of the National Tournament; Valtryk's gone missing.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6658020/screencap/65d4cf8055733.jpg"},{"title":"The Winged Snake! Quetziko!","synopsis":"Beigoma Club battles against Ice Blaze in the first round of the Nationals.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6660479/screencap/65d4cfd84f03a.jpg"},{"title":"Teachings of a Legend!","synopsis":"After losing his battle to Quon Limon, a discouraged Valt tries to reconnect with Valtryek.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6788018/screencap/65d4d013e34ff.jpg"},{"title":"Cyclone Power!","synopsis":"Zac invites the Beigoma team to a theme park where they meet the most powerful Blader in the country.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6788019/screencap/65d4d057b351e.jpg"},{"title":"Mega Flames! Dual Sabers!","synopsis":"The Club faces the Sword Flames in the second round; Wakiya challenges Valt's leadership.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6795596/screencap/65d4d089f1076.jpg"},{"title":"The Beasts Bare Their Fangs!","synopsis":"Valt and Ken practice together and discover a new power in Valtryek.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6799428/screencap/65d4d0a981eaa.jpg"},{"title":"Primal Attack! Beast Betromoth!","synopsis":"The Beigoma Academy Bey Club comes up with a strategy to take down the Beasts; Valtryek gives Valt a boost.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6805847/screencap/65d4d0d3154fc.jpg"},{"title":"Rideout Rising!","synopsis":"Zac and Gabe battle; the Beigoma Academy Bey Club is the subject of a video documentary; Valt makes a rival.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6805848/screencap/65d4d12935aea.jpg"},{"title":"Next Stop, Team Finals!","synopsis":"The team picks an unusual way to train.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6812837/screencap/65d4d15ced749.jpg"},{"title":"Battle to the Finish! Lost Luinor","synopsis":"The Beigoma Beyclub and Rideout collide at the National Team Finals.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6812838/screencap/65d4d184a12ad.jpg"},{"title":"Into the Vortex! Lost Spiral!","synopsis":"The showdown between Valt and Lui continues; one team emerges victorious.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6827828/screencap/65d4d1c62c292.jpg"},{"title":"All In! Going Solo!","synopsis":"A strange scientist offers to measure Valt's launching technique before the National Individual Tournament begins.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6827829/screencap/65d4d215a6a0b.jpg"},{"title":"Nepstrius` Trap!","synopsis":"Valt competes against mad scientist Naoki in the first round of individual competition.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6829336/screencap/65d4d27d21b2a.jpg"},{"title":"Jumbo Jormuntor! The Venomous Snake!","synopsis":"Shu faces an opponent rumored to be underhanded.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6837269/screencap/65d4d2ab5761d.jpg"},{"title":"Winged Launch!","synopsis":"Zac has competition for the love of his fans; Valt has a rematch with Quon.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6837271/screencap/65d4d2d7e86c5.jpg"},{"title":"Roar! Battle of the Beasts!","synopsis":"Two beasts face each other in the second round; Gabe takes on Zac the Sunshine.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6838990/screencap/65d4d2f4ba32f.jpg"},{"title":"Spryzen vs. Wyvron","synopsis":"Wakiya finally gets his shot at redemption when he is pitted against Shu.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6847932/screencap/65d4d345a661c.jpg"},{"title":"Battle for the Top! Valt vs Xander!","synopsis":"Valt must do something he has never done before - win against Xander.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6847933/screencap/65d4d37191375.jpg"},{"title":"Star Battle!","synopsis":"Zac battles to maintain his title against an upstart pop star who looks to topple him.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6854485/screencap/65d4d3b26d8f9.jpg"},{"title":"Semi-Finals! Spin Versus Speed!","synopsis":"Valt and Zac battle to decide who will move onto the final.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6854643/screencap/65d4d3cf12139.jpg"},{"title":"Old Rivals! Lui Versus Shu!","synopsis":"Shu seeks to avenge last tournament's loss to Lui and honor his promise to meet Valt in the final.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6861132/screencap/65d4d3fd39523.jpg"},{"title":"Overthrowing the King!","synopsis":"At long last, the battle to determine the winner of the National Individual Tournament begins.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6861133/screencap/65d4d47e58d9c.jpg"},{"title":"Final Showdown! Victory Valtryek!","synopsis":"The best Blader in the country will finally be decided.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/6861134/screencap/65d4d4c2a83bd.jpg"}],"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
